    "text": "Share:\nHealth-Fitness & Leisure Expo\nHealth-Fitness & Leisure Expo, 9 a.m. to 3 p.m., Cape Henlopen High School, Lewes. Benefits Alzheimer’s Association Delaware Valley Chapter. Over 100 exhibitors offering full array of health, fitness, leisure and home products and services, free admission, free health screenings by Beebe Healthcare. For more information contact Kathy at 302-236-0857 or kathy@deexpos.com.\nEvent Details:\nEvent Date:\nSat, 03/07/2026 - 9:00am to 3:00pm",
